{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eb1ad84dc020e492e6da0195f387159817adaa18003c24d6aafa90553f2576ed",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00605ce0d896777e97c20eb510b9e3f6d5cdbbe2479d722f50bf057b37fd5e6b",
      "text": "“兴奋期待”与“坐立不安”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0827763c66e08529a85a1d44175bdd1e4379ec780db570d3848433b4ec1c9bf",
      "text": "花音的生日快到了。\n期待着能得到大家祝福的花音，\n却完全看不到制作人和直央他们\n在筹备生日的迹象……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ebb8b01122ec908ab6e183986ef4cf4f496dd922f7c481c7b9136c318f6dbff",
      "text": "直——央——！快点啦。\n休息室门上的装饰也必须得做对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f6df0e5ba264235ae51253072e8561fd424f992229e68d4eff7a2c680378249",
      "text": "离花音君来还有时间，\n不用那么着急的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d03c56a111cd6cf7d31c8149a5b38c1ef6f37e123900a93ef5891f7ac58ce3",
      "text": "说什么呢。\n还有别的事要做呢，麻利点过去啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00102bea5ed89f39899bcdf6254c5a25e3316e618f4e11528dce44d86158f927",
      "text": "啊，等等。\n这个小兔子装饰马上就做好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dc3de4ab41045d52a99e42f3f861bf31620a83622ec76352619d59d9b2d9e30",
      "text": "真是的，拿你没办法——！\n我也来帮你，胶水和剪刀借我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb1c68d9a72a01b8ca540df5ba57dd5463b542c5a67c2ce2681dc2f4a1a76b7",
      "text": "呐呐，直央君。\n给花音的生日准备，是从什么时候开始的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336b5608a2287f884ed5b7d54d9163a59d15d388c1373ddeb9e5ce10be4f8970",
      "text": "那个……\n大概是过了新年之后的时期吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c05d20321fc655d05b29b27a060ddadde75aa728208b67b80eefa44a6b4eea2",
      "text": "那么早开始的！？花音完全没注意到……\n真不愧是演技派呢，直央君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7ecebaf931cc485fad9aca428df985ec0bd76479e5954caf770b8e63c243ff",
      "text": "呵呵。\n因为花音君很敏锐，我之前还一直担心会不会露馅呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bba5e0df2d7e810e95d949fc740ca30d1e52f76d17b328a1438fece380070520",
      "text": "完全看不出来呢～。\n不过多亏了大家，度过了一个美好的生日！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:321cd54acb21f9e059510114e3f25f771880948681fcb1aff8bbe3c05dd4a1ec",
      "text": "怎么样，超厉害的派对吧！\n布置装饰也是全由我们搞定的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614176c8077c0fe320c9268ecda0df4ffef8598d115cacf7ff4730ed2c7fd7d5",
      "text": "嗯，超～级厉害！\n门上的花朵装饰也是志狼君他们做的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27dd26aedfa9668f1321c0047abcadff6cfb7edd07bac8e5530c7cd9d176f2d0",
      "text": "是啊。\n红色和蓝色的全——是我弄的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97a34911a5d77e7bca1a7f3ad49c5b562e810df087b1289331d6dced7a6be5e0",
      "text": "好漂亮哦，谢谢你！那个是\n被邀请去幼儿园结业典礼时做过的纸花对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a409de4c406431ab541702e7c39d8c935aa4a7b02e94b361a35867c002e89a0c",
      "text": "没错没错！\n比起那时候，做得更——加好看了对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
